# Project 5: Network Traffic Analysis Using Wireshark, TCPdump, Nmap and Fowsniff CTF

## Introduction

In this project, I analyzed network traffic using Wireshark, TCPdump, and Nmap, and investigated network activity through the Fowsniff CTF from TryHackMe. I captured and inspected packets, identified network services, analyzed TCP and HTTP traffic, and investigated suspicious activity.

The project helped me develop practical network-analysis skills relevant to SOC monitoring, network reconnaissance, incident investigation, and basic network forensics.

